        <item>
            <title>2.46.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:23:27 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>137</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.46.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- A live mirror pane of another Mac now shows that Mac's Claude account usage in the sidebar, alongside this Mac's own bars. No second block is added when both Macs use the same account.

### Changes
- Settings: the Mobile tab is now split in two. **Sharing** holds relay publishing and the live mirror (used by phones and other Macs); **Remote** holds saved SSH hosts and paired Other Macs.
- The Settings window can now be resized.
]]></description>
